#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: aludra.php includes/admin/settings-page.php:22
msgid "Aludra"
msgstr "Aludra"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: aludra.php
msgid "https://github.com/imagewize/aludra"
msgstr "https://github.com/imagewize/aludra"

#. Description of the plugin
#: aludra.php
msgid ""
"A page builder made of real blocks — 34 blocks, 21 section patterns and 8 "
"page layouts for everything between the header and the footer. Native block "
"editor, no shortcodes, no proprietary markup. Built alongside the Aviendha "
"starter theme; works with any theme."
msgstr ""
"Een paginabouwer van echte blokken: 34 blokken, 21 sectiepatronen en 8 "
"paginalay-outs voor alles tussen de header en de footer. Native blokeditor, "
"geen shortcodes, geen eigen opmaak. Gebouwd naast het Aviendha-startthema; "
"werkt met elk thema."

#. Author of the plugin
#: aludra.php
msgid "Jasper Frumau"
msgstr "Jasper Frumau"

