"developer app or API key. Loads only after a visitor clicks 'Load feed', so "
"nothing from instagram.com fires before consent. Unofficial and undocumented "
"by Meta: this is the same kind of endpoint that broke without notice in 2020 "
"(Meta's old oEmbed shutdown) — verify it still works before relying on it, "
"and always give the client a plain profile link as a fallback."
msgstr ""
"Live Instagram-profielfeed via de eigen openbare embed-iframe van Instagram "
"— geen ontwikkelaarsapp of API-sleutel. Laadt pas nadat een bezoeker op "
